Z||000017||StuGood||08-01-2001||07:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Raydar:<BR><B>Stu, I give up. Unless you're talking about the hood prop, or the decklid vents.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>That's it-! I was thinking of the telescoping latching hood prop.  It sure looks like the same part as what holds up the front compartment lid on the Fiero (okay, so the brackets on the end are probably different).<P>Way simpler than those hydraulic/ pneumatic struts they use nowadays!  And reliable, too.<P>50 points, and a chance at the washer dryer, Raydar!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>||||reg||14
